#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:301
msgid ""
"Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the "
"current user's data, or pass user_id to target another account when the "
"caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests "
"return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found."
msgstr ""
"So&#39;rovlar uchun tizimga kirgan WordPress foydalanuvchisi kerak "
"bo&#39;ladi. Joriy foydalanuvchi ma&#39;lumotlaridan foydalanish uchun "
"user_id ni qoldiring yoki qo&#39;ng&#39;iroq qiluvchi o&#39;sha "
"foydalanuvchini tahrirlay olganda (edit_user imkoniyati) boshqa hisobga "
"yo&#39;naltirish uchun user_id ni uzating. Tasdiqlanmagan so&#39;rovlar "
"fc_api_forbidden qaytaradi. Noto&#39;g&#39;ri user_id fc_api_user_not_found "
"qaytaradi."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:316
msgid "HTTP 200 with { \"data\": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload."
msgstr ""
"Qayta ishlash vositasi foydali yukni qaytarganda, HTTP 200 "
"{&quot;data&quot;: { ... } } bilan."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:317
msgid ""
"HTTP 200 with { \"success\": true } when there is no payload (for example "
"DELETE)."
msgstr ""
"Hech qanday foydali yuklama bo&#39;lmaganda (masalan, DELETE) HTTP 200 "
"{&quot;success&quot;: true} bilan."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:318
msgid ""
"Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, "
"data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix."
msgstr ""
"Xatoliklar WP_Error (kod, xabar, data.status) dan WordPress REST xatosi "
"JSON ni qaytaradi. Sim kodlari fc_api_* prefiksidan foydalanadi."

